{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SpookY2K</strong> is a <strong>comedic mystery visual novel</strong> with character <strong>customization</strong> and (optional) <strong>romance</strong>. Get to know the <strong>other party guests</strong> and discover the truth about what's going on over the span of 6 interwoven routes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097180/extras/fc2db4be22050fddfb3117cc325e8b1b.avif?t=1773510224\" width=1560 height=452 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...You wake up on a cold bathroom floor with a headache and no memories except a terrible sense of foreboding.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Something <strong>has </strong>happened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Something <strong>is </strong>happening.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Something <strong>will </strong>happen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even worse, you figure out you somehow travelled back in time,\u00a0to the cusp of the 2000s \u2014 a <strong>Halloween party in 1999</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At least\u00a0the other guests, <strong>6 singles ready to mingle</strong>, welcome you and don't seem to notice anything is wrong... for now.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maybe, as you get closer to them, you can discover the dark truth about yourself?\u00a0Or will your clueless involvement allow the party to\u00a0take a <strong>deadly </strong>turn...?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cast</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097180/extras/a00cda3687044f060f7b1e50c803f620.avif?t=1773510224\" width=850 height=850 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097180/extras/3caf9f6fbadb93b922c47a0e7586feb7.avif?t=1773510224\" width=850 height=850 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097180/extras/d48be42ee4ab86989f01ad3970e57b74.avif?t=1773510224\" width=850 height=850 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097180/extras/ceca97967746f2a30174c570e1dfe23b.avif?t=1773510224\" width=850 height=850 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097180/extras/9495b95e70e256f9b2d16867f5eb7812.avif?t=1773510224\" width=850 height=850 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097180/extras/b669f76bee96332fd7ba3dfd00d41483.avif?t=1773510224\" width=850 height=850 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4097180?t=1773510224","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097180/67e49d2c4c96a5d8c12f934f69e0f95113970dc8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773510224","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097180/cbfad50ef3e94347509975eecd2ebc835d62f25f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773510224","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097180/cbfad50ef3e94347509975eecd2ebc835d62f25f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773510224","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{